8:["$","$Ld",null,{"title":"Dashboard refinement","text":"Keep the current data model, visual system, and account table. Improve the health trend and account drawer only.\n\nMake the trend readable without relying on color, add exact values on focus or hover, and explain which changes contributed to the selected account's score. Do not add new metrics or dashboard cards."}]
